led maintains flexibility for higher-scoring patterns.\n\nReason: Passing maintains hand concealment for potential \"Concealed Hand\" or \"Fully Concealed Hand\" bonus points. My W suit (W1-W2-W3-W4) provides a stronger structural foundation with better tile availability for forming multiple chows. Exposing the Bamboo chow would fragment the hand and limit future options without significant strategic benefit.\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
